    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The problem is, the open-access stuff is a bit too surface-level for the heavy-duty synthesis the lab needs. If you're mostly just scanning arXiv, we're basically paying for an expensive interface to do what a standard search engine can do. The PI is actually questioning if we even need a specialized research agent if we're losing access to the core data sources you were built to leverage.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
